  "description": "Jieum hears the news that Seungjo, whom she has harbor-longingly crushed on since high school, has a girlfriend. Wanting to pour out her wounded heart somewhere, she stumbles upon a chatting app called , where she meets 'Jemulpo Puppy' and has a brief escape from reality. Then, after winter break, she returns to school for the new semester. 'Wait, wait a minute. Why is that person here?!' There, she comes face to face with 'Jemulpo Puppy', whom she thought she would never see again... \"Found you, little pebble.\" \\*\\*Original Webtoon:\\*\\* \\[RIDI\\](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404039183?srsltid=AfmBOorQCTJjAx1KJ2LWP0eWH9Y8W1caJ0934OM5raIjGoFiTkj5CJXh)",
